# Terraform local cache and modules (all project folders)
**/.terraform/*

# Terraform state files (all project folders)
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Terraform crash logs (all project folders)
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Ignore CLI config files that may contain credentials
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# Ignore override files (all project folders)
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Ignore variable definitions that often contain secrets
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Keep lock files tracked so CI resolves the same provider versions every run.
# (The `**/.terraform/*` rule above already excludes the provider binaries;
# the lock file itself lives beside the .tf files and must stay committed.)
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
